# Repo ini di-clone di Windows. Skrip yang dijalankan di Ubuntu (WSL) wajib berakhir baris LF,
# file Windows (.bat, .ps1) wajib CRLF, apa pun setelan core.autocrlf di laptop.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.onnx binary
